WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,820 --> 00:00:01,740
Teacher Jiang

2
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:03,540
How dare you let me go today?

3
00:00:05,940 --> 00:00:07,060
When you see a snake

4
00:00:07,060 --> 00:00:08,060
Although my hands are shaking

5
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:09,900
But there is courage in the eyes

6
00:00:11,370 --> 00:00:12,610
Previously in Silverland

7
00:00:12,610 --> 00:00:14,330
They all say I can only read

8
00:00:14,770 --> 00:00:15,850
It's of no use at all

9
00:00:16,290 --> 00:00:18,280
It's no use reading

10
00:00:18,280 --> 00:00:19,360
It’s not like I’ve practiced my hands in vain

11
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:23,780
Otherwise, how could we save Fang Xiaoman? Starting tomorrow

12
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:26,530
Luowu, come to me

13
00:00:26,930 --> 00:00:28,360
Dare to pick a snake

14
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:30,040
I'm still afraid that I won't be able to make a pot of brine.

15
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:42,670
Slow down and close your eyes

16
00:00:43,070 --> 00:00:46,940
It's all that snake, you say

17
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:48,930
Teacher Jiang's side

18
00:00:49,130 --> 00:00:50,770
Do you eat better than us?

19
00:00:51,720 --> 00:00:54,160
What are you thinking about? I want to sleep with you.
